{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/168044-revised-contracts-gmc","id":168044,"title":"Revised Contracts (GMC)?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-13T10:22:55-07:00","id":168044,"title":"Revised Contracts (GMC)?","content":"<span style=\"font-size:10px\">Contracts are clunky and some powers need serious revision. Here's my take on Contracts of the Dream<br /> <br /> <b>Contracts of the Dream</b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dream-catcher (\u2022)</b></span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">The changeling is able to sense dreaming people in the area, and the nearest open gate to the Hedge.</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dice pool: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">None</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Cost: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">1 Glamour</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Catch:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Took a torn from the Hedge within the 24 hours and spilled blood while doing it.</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">The changeling perceives all sleeping minds within the same building or overall location. He can analyze the Hedge rolling Intelligence + Wyrd asking one question per success:</span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:10px\">What's the dreamer's most prominent emotion?</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\">How intense is the dream?</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\">What kind of dream is the dreamer having (ex. recurring, wish fulfillment, recalling, prophetic, nightmare, none)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Is the dreamer supernatural or otherwise not human?</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Is the dreamer lucid?</span></li> </ul><br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">He\u2019s also able to determine the nearest open gate to the Hedge. He can analyze the Hedge rolling Intelligence + Wyrd asking one question per success:</span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">How far is the gate from me?</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Are there any shortcuts, Hollows, or path?</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">What kind of goblin fruits grow in this part of the Hedge?</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Is there anything dangerous in this part of the Hedge?</span></span></li> </ul><br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Forge dream (\u2022\u2022)</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">The changeling is able to enter dreams without being in the Hedge. He\u2019s also able to enter dreams more easily while in the Hedge.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dice pool: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Wits + Wyrd - Intensity of the dream</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Cost: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">1 Glamour</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Catch:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> The changeling must be standing or sitting near the victim, touching his own and the dreamer\u2019s temple, or the changeling must be in a Hollow.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Success: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The changeling can enter the dreams of a characters immediately, as long as it\u2019s sleeping, and dictate the content, though it can\u2019t make the dreamer dream about his death. The changeling can also spend Glamour to reduce the difficulty of entering a dream in the Hedge by 2 per Glamour spent.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Exceptional success: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The changeling has +1 to all rolls inside that dream.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Phantasmal bastion (\u2022\u2022\u2022), Cobblethought (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022) and Dreamsteps (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b>: see Changeling the Lost</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":316,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","user":"Jesuncolo","date":". 06-13-2014, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T05:05:31-07:00","id":177836,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping for Onyx Path to get a green light to make the Fair Folk Chronicles or the equvilent...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}